        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PD007-PASS, Palo Alto Arched Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Palo Alto Pocket Door Passage Set manages to look contemporary without the sharp edges and square-shapes that so many modern door hardware pieces have adapted in the last few years. The arched design is sleek and clean, spanning the gap between classic tastes and the need for modern designs. A passage set, the PD007 comes packaged with two pulls, one for each side of the door.  It has just a .15 inch projection that makes it great for sliding pocket doors. It is installed by mortising it into the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/privacy-palo-alto-pocket-door-set-baldwin-pd007-priv\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/keyed-entry-palo-alto-pocket-door-set-baldwin-pd007-entr\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Palo Alto Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 8.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .15\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1.6\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 6.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Depth: .25\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Door Thickness: 1.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-PD007-specifications.gif?v=1704354535\" width=\"189\" height=\"266\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin PD007 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
